      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-16T14:47:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Manipulating Spite is one of the easiest ways to take him out. He can become a real pushover if you can become immune to his damage or reduce his damage to the point where he isn't do anything. He also lacks destruction which makes it that much easier. It's also Plague Rat's weakness, granted infections can still cause some slight problems.</p>",
